      "text": "DAy 15 - Data Routing and authentication project:\ndata routing learning: \nToday i learnt data routing, what is difference\nbetween declarative routing and data routing. first i created\nthree pages about.jsx, home.jsx, services.jsx and after that\nI created two layout AuthLayout.jsx and MainLayout.jsx\nThen I created router foder and inside AppRoutes.jsx \ncomponenet inside that first I create router variable and store\nvalue of createBrowerRouter. inside CreatedBrowserRouter\nI pass array [] (array is a routes) and inside array I passed\nobject (object is a route) inside object path, element and \nchildren receive I gave path \"/\", element <MainLayout.jsx/> and\nanother object pass path:\"/auth\" and element:<Auth/> and inside \nmainlayout.jsx I pass children for mainLayout.jsx I pass 3 children 1st path: \"\", \nelement; <Home/> 2nd path: \"about\", element: <About/> and 3rd\npath: \"services\", element: <Services/>.\nI created navbar.jsx component inside that I created navbar\non navbar left side logo, right side login button and center side \nI use <Navlink/> and pass path:\"/\" for home page componenet, Path:\"about\"\nfor about page and for services path:\"services\", then i pass navbar component\nin MainLayout.jsx and wrot <Outlet/> component also for receive\nchildren like home, about and services.\n\nAuthentication project:\nalso in this class i created project for authenction using react-router\nI created another vite project name is day15_Auth-Project.jsx\nand inside i created folder componenets inside file Navbar.jsx\ncontext folder inside AuthContext.jsx, layouts folder inside\nAuthLayout.jsx and MainLayout.jsx file, Pages folder inside \ncontactPage.jsx, homepage.jsx, loginPage.jsx, registerpage.jsx, and\nshoppage.jsx, router folder inside approuter.jsx and protextedRouter.jsx\n\nnow In AppRouter.jsx I wrote data routing, path: \"/\" auth is present\ninsde two child login.jsx and register.jsx path:\"login\" and Path: \"register\"\nand another routes path:\"/main\" inside protectedRouter.jsx I wrapped\nmainLayout.jsx inside mainlayout.jsx children is homepage, shopPage, and\ncontactpage.jsx\non shoppage.jsx i use axios to fetch data from fack store api. \nand I store that data in getProductData state. and use for make \nproduct card using map function on state. \nI desing home.page, contact page. shoppage also, so ui lookin beautifull.\nfor register page user register and directy reach on /main page\nregister user data i store in localstore and on navbar i used logout functionality also\nwhen user logout user can directly login accout usign email and password\nwhen user try login first match the registration with email and password \nthen it correct user went on /main. I use toastify when login creatinatial wrong \nit's show invalid user and when correct it's show name you loggedin inside name user name come\nlike vaibhav you loggedin.",
